DESCRIPTION:Will AI replace comedians? Don McMillan definitively answers th
 at question in this year’s Tour that features Fresh Charts\, Graphs\, Ve
 nn Diagrams and Lots of Laughs!Don McMillan isn’t your typical stand-up c
 omic. A former Silicon Valley engineer turned viral sensation\, Don blends
  his technical background with razor-sharp wit to deliver what’s been ca
 lled “The Funniest PowerPoint Presentation You’ll Ever See!” Recently
  featured on America’s Got Talent\, Don made it to the Top 12 and perfor
 med in the Finals\, earning rave reviews from all the judges—including S
 imon Cowell.Don’s comedy is smart\, clean\, and wildly relatable. His You
 Tube videos attract fans from all over the world. His signature video\, 
 “Life After Death by PowerPoint\,” has been viewed by more than 50 mil
 lion times and has made him a favorite among corporate audiences including
  Apple\, Microsoft\, Amazon and Google. Don won the San Francisco Internat
 ional Comedy Competition and has also appeared on The Tonight Show\, HBO\,
  Comedy Central and was the First Dry Bar comedian to surpass 1 million In
 stagram followers\, a milestone unmatched by many of his peers.\nMore info
 : https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/don-mcmillan/
